{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: Java backend engineering, focusing on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. Explicitly NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like \"主题\" (topic) + \"场景\" (scenario) + \"类型\" (type). The types include:\n- 概念速览 (concept overview)\n- 操作记录 (operation record - reproduction scenarios, logs, debugging)\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles)\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation - community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture)\n- 市场观察 (market observation - training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings)\n\nThe user explicitly does NOT want training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking content. So \"市场观察\" (market observation) candidates should be excluded since they all describe \"展示培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名\" (training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings).\n\nAlso \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) candidates describe \"整理技术社区活动、软件发展沿革与开发者访谈，介绍团队协作背景和行业文化\" - these are about community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture. These are less relevant to the user's interest in database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. They seem tangential.\n\nThe user's interest focuses on: 数据库 (database), 并发 (concurrency), 服务故障处理 (service fault handling) implementation and principles.\n\nLet me categorize the topics:\n- 事务传播 (transaction propagation) - database/transaction\n- 缓存失效 (cache invalidation) - service\n- 任务取消 (task cancellation) - concurrency\n- 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing) - concurrency\n- 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting) - database\n- 接口幂等 (interface idempotency) - service\n- 组合索引 (composite index) - database\n- 慢查询 (slow query) - database\n- 并发更新 (concurrent update) - concurrency/database\n- 消息重复 (message duplication) - service/messaging\n\nThe most relevant content types for the user's interest in \"实现与原理\" (implementation and principles) would be:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions and principles) - directly about principles\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - about fault handling, debugging, reproduction\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - concepts\n\nThe least relevant:\n- 市场观察 (market observation) - explicitly excluded by user\n- 专题观察 (special topic observation) - about community/industry culture, not technical implementation\n\nLet me count the candidates. There are 80 candidates in the working set. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are relevant. Given the user's interest in database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles, and explicit exclusion of training/certificate/salary content.\n\nLet me filter out 市场观察 (market observation) candidates first since they're explicitly excluded. Let me identify them by description containing \"培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名\".\n\nMarket observation candidates:\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27 (线程池排队：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-0af1c4827cd8 (连接池等待：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-0be6197962c6 (接口幂等：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-10482516c15c (缓存失效：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-1178ddd58b15 (并发更新：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-1a7442187146 (线程池排队：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-1c3f785dd079 (任务取消：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3356f301eff1 (事务传播：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-34481c910531 (连接池等待：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3b9f2dc9469c (事务传播：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3cca11fe4770 (并发更新：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-3dd8795cff7b (组合索引：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-4780c84a7983 (消息重复：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-50c1d851bc3e (连接池等待：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-5844dd71f1b0 (任务取消：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-5fcb0644cc52 (接口幂等：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-636d70dcfcba (接口幂等：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n\nThese should all be excluded.\n\nNow, the 专题观察 (special topic observation) candidates describe community activities, software history, developer interviews, team culture. These are less aligned with the user's technical interest in implementation and principles. The user's interest is about \"实现与原理\" (implementation and principles). These 专题观察 articles are about industry culture/community, which is not what the user wants. I'll deprioritize these.\n\nLet me focus on the technical content types: 条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览.\n\nLet me identify all candidates of these three types across the topics.\n\nLet me list the candidates and their types:\n\n**事务传播 (transaction propagation):**\n- item-017f29068cff: 专题观察 (内容管理接口)\n- item-167782abe824: 条件与原理 (内容管理接口)\n- item-2c20f0a4b41e: 专题观察 (后台处理任务)\n- item-356556f36ad8: 概念速览 (后台处理任务)\n- item-3b6e33dce189: 条件与原理 (社区服务)\n- item-3b9f2dc9469c: 市场观察 (内容管理接口)\n- item-45f8ac57ea42: 操作记录 (内容管理接口)\n- item-493d69ea1678: 条件与原理 (消息消费者)\n- item-3356f301eff1: 市场观察 (消息消费者)\n\n**缓存失效 (cache invalidation):**\n- item-042e55d675a0: 操作记录 (社区服务)\n- item-05526cd9d6f6: 专题观察 (社区服务)\n- item-10482516c15c: 市场观察 (消息消费者)\n- item-17427e9b8667: 概念速览 (社区服务)\n- item-3c858ef0f07f: 概念速览 (内容管理接口)\n- item-43d0c40117a8: 概念速览 (消息消费者)\n- item-5987d238b7de: 操作记录 (后台处理任务)\n\n**任务取消 (task cancellation):**\n- item-07ad7c7c66a5: 条件与原理 (内容管理接口)\n- item-1c3f785dd079: 市场观察 (内容管理接口)\n- item-38229375fac7: 操作记录 (后台处理任务)\n- item-4321501c7f4d: 概念速览 (后台处理任务)\n- item-501f16c5db37: 条件与原理 (社区服务)\n- item-52cdcfdacb13: 操作记录 (消息消费者)\n- item-5844dd71f1b0: 市场观察 (消息消费者)\n- item-5b1d60a35a47: 操作记录 (内容管理接口)\n- item-5d2fe500c260: 专题观察 (社区服务)\n- item-664fac62b6b2: 专题观察 (内容管理接口)\n\n**线程池排队 (thread pool queueing):**\n- item-07b1bd992c27: 概念速览 (消息消费者)\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27: 市场观察 (社区服务)\n- item-0b384ee33ac6: 概念速览 (内容管理接口)\n- item-1a7442187146: 市场观察 (后台处理任务)\n- item-5b30b4b228eb: 专题观察 (消息消费者)\n- item-5ccc33f5cce3: 条件与原理 (消息消费者)\n- item-5feeb605a5de: 专题观察 (后台处理任务)\n\n**连接池等待 (connection pool waiting):**\n- item-098771075993: 操作记录 (内容管理接口)\n- item-0af1c4827cd8: 市场观察 (后台处理任务)\n- item-16f7b9cc23ce: 专题观察 (消息消费者)\n- item-1ba5c7242ee5: 操作记录 (后台处理任务)\n-